and `schema/registry.json` requires exactly those six. `schemas/PI-PKG.schema.json` additionally
declares `"trace": {}`. An empty schema accepts ANY JSON value, including `12345678` and `null`.

`src/pipd_ls_sp/validate.py::semantic_invariants` only coerces with `str(...)`:
